## SUCCESS CRITERIA

Agent Engine phase is successful when:

1. All 15 agents defined
2. All agent definitions complete and valid
3. All agent dependencies mapped
4. Orchestration rules defined
5. No agent overlap or conflicts
6. All agents have Definition of Done
7. All agents have success metrics
8. Passes agent validation

